{"dog":{"age_group":"senior","application_url":"https://amaanimalrescue.org/adoption-application/","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Chihuahua Mix","breed_primary":"Chihuahua Mix","description_text":"With his adorable face, gentle eyes, and sweet personality, Jack is impossible not to fall in love with. This handsome boy was found as a stray and brought into our care. While the world can feel a little overwhelming to him at first, he’s slowly learning that people can be kind and comforting.\n\nJack takes a bit of time to warm up to new people, and sudden movements can frighten him a bit, so he would do best in a calm and patient home that will let him build confidence at his own pace. Once he feels safe, though, Jack’s affectionate side truly comes out. He loves being held close, soaking up cuddles, and enjoying quiet moments with the people he trusts most.\n\nJack is a soft-hearted little dog who just wants to feel safe and loved. With patience, understanding, and plenty of reassurance, this sweet boy will make a wonderfully loyal companion.","detail_url":"https://amaanimalrescue.org/pet/jack/","id":"a8b566a84def32a91afdf2bb97bf6212","image_urls":["https://amaanimalrescue.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/f0d33c2c-e57f-41bd-af2b-bfe55c59b976-683x1024.jpg","https://amaanimalrescue.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/a3d97130-efb9-463b-bbf0-6ce4efa8dd1f-682x1024.jpg","https://amaanimalrescue.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/20152159-0763-4d9e-9737-994bfa7a19d5-683x1024.jpg","https://amaanimalrescue.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/9791d415-5e2b-43df-8ed9-bf1d5348a1fa-683x1024.jpg","https://amaanimalrescue.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/563daaf4-2220-4e18-ab40-c9d358183b77-scaled-e1778958420712-1024x998.jpg","https://amaanimalrescue.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/848cb22f-0f02-44c0-98f6-1fa98f9e39dc-scaled-768x1024.jpg","https://amaanimalrescue.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/4798aa62-dd7a-4dd5-a9e2-1f97b7665ac0-scaled-768x1024.jpg","https://amaanimalrescue.org/wp